\ Bounded-memory regression for the tagged inner box.
\
\ Each virtual-type wrap used to allocate its inner box on the context
\ arena, which is never reclaimed on the main task, so these loops grew
\ by roughly 40 bytes per iteration and exhausted the 2 MB cap set in
\ the `.flags` sidecar partway through. The box now lives in a
\ refcounted backing on the general allocator and frees at the drop, so
\ the loops stay flat and print the marker.

gauge: virtual{ fixnum } ;

20000 [ 42 >gauge drop ] times

20000 [ 42 >gauge unmake-gauge drop ] times

"flat" print-line
